    "title": "Reset your password",
    "body": "Open Settings, choose Security, and select Reset password. We email you a link that expires after one hour."
  },
  {
    "slug": "refund-an-invoice",
    "title": "Refund an invoice",
    "body": "Refunds go back to the original payment method. Open the invoice, choose Refund, and enter the amount. A refund on a paid invoice takes five business days."
  },
